OL,3,GNEWSAShop linked to people smuggler has
OL,4,Alicence revoked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop in Leicestershire with links to
OL,7,Fa convicted people smuggler has had its
OL,8,Flicence to sell alcohol revoked.
OL,10,FA BBC investigation traced Twana Jamal
OL,11,FKhdir, once described as "the
OL,12,Fgodfather" of the French migrant camps,
OL,13,Fto Blaby where reporters witnessed him
OL,14,Fworking illegally in two shops in the
OL,15,Fvillage.
OL,17,FKhdir, an Iraqi national, was later
OL,18,Farrested and charged with immigration
OL,19,Foffences.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
