OL,3,GNEWSAShop linked to people smuggler has
OL,4,Alicence revoked
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlaby District Council said it had
OL,7,Fwithdrawn the licence of one of the
OL,8,Fshops - Candy Corner 1 in Lutterworth
OL,9,FRoad - over concerns that included
OL,10,Fallegations of the sale of alcohol to
OL,11,Funder-age customers.
